text: "Jordan Reyes\nChicago, IL · jordan.reyes@example.com · (312) 555-0147\n\nSummary\nSoftware engineer with 3 years of software development at Brightline Labs. I rewrote our payments API in Golang (p99 down 38% across 4M requests a day), built the ML ranking service behind search (click-through up 12%), and I run the on-call rotation for our 9 services, where my automated runbooks cut pages 60%. I care about keeping services reliable. Tools: Golang, Python, SQL, Postgres, k8s, Docker, GCP, debugging, monitoring, profiling.\n\nExperience\nSoftware Engineer, Brightline Labs, Chicago, IL, 2023 to present\n- Worked on backend services\n- Helped with machine learning projects\n- Responsible for on-call\n- Wrote design docs and ran design reviews for the payments rewrite with product and finance stakeholders\n- Did code reviews and unit tests for the team\n- Moved our services onto k8s on GCP, containerized with Docker\n\nSoftware Engineering Intern, Brightline Labs, Chicago, IL, Summer 2022\n- Built an internal dashboard for support tickets\n\nEducation\nUniversity of Michigan, B.S.E. in Computer Science, 2023\nCoursework: data structures, distributed computing, operating systems\n"
